## Scope and remaining audit

This closes the outbound RPC deadline/local-write completion behavior slice.
Queued-byte writability accounting and framework-specific write-completion
visibility remain documented. Broad P18-V01 source/API/settings/input/error/
control-flow and reverse-export reconciliation remains PARTIAL. Native Windows
runtime, current-revision remote Ubuntu CI, and Phase 19 Broker/Docker validation
